''Prove your strength and skill - the Doom of Mokhaiotl Combat Achievements are here!''

==Changelog September 3rd==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK HERE TO SHOW}}
'''Varlamore Combat Achievements'''

* The Doom of Mokhaiotl Combat Achievements have now arrived. For details, see the table in the blog below!

'''Doom Boss Changes'''

* Volatile Earth node attack options now deactivate instantly after the Earthen shield spawns.
* Falling grubs no longer show an attack option until they land, preventing misclicks during the spawn animation.

'''Client and Mobile Updates'''

* Players in the new Renderer Beta will see improved visuals across multiple areas, with fixes for flickering in Motherload mine, Stronghold of Security, the Fremennik Isles, Draynor Manor, White Wolf Mountain, Catherby, Seers Village, and Camelot Castle.
* Stash Units are now correctly visible above the terrain with the new renderer beta, fixing previous clipping issues.

'''Other Changes'''

* Fixed an issue where Partner Slayer could assign tasks that one partner didn’t meet the requirements for.
* Some grammar has been corrected in the descriptions of Varlamore citizens.
* Gaining loot from the Wilderness Agility Course now requires an open looting bag, preventing loot from being traded away without risk.
** Players can no longer destroy their looting bag while inside the course.
** Looting bags are still automatically provided after paying the 150K fee.
** Players will need to have free space in the looting bag to claim loot.

'''PvP Rota'''
The PvP rota has moved to '''Period A''':

* 539 - (US) - PvP World
* 318 - (UK) - Bounty Hunter World
* 548 - (Germany) - High-Risk PvP World
* 577 - (US) - Free-to-Play PvP World
* 559 - (UK) - LMS Competitive

World 390 (AUS) for LMS Competitive has been '''activated''' with this rota.

World 569 (AUS) for Bounty Hunter has been '''activated''' with this rota.

The PvP Arena is using '<b>Max/Med</b>' loadouts in Ranked Duels and Tournaments this week.
{{Collapsed section end}}

