Thinking, 'been there done that?' for some of these? Not to worry, the following tasks will be retroactive, meaning you won't need to grind them out again if you've already completed them:

* Doom Adept
* Doom Crawler
* Doom Veteran
* Doom Chaser
* Doom Racer
* It's Dark Down Here

As for the rest, well, good luck down there! Try not to let the Doom live up to its name.

==Doom Boss Changes==
Alongside the new Combat Achievements, we’ve done a bit of spring cleaning to spare those poor misclicking fingers:

* Volatile Earth node attack options now deactivate instantly after the Earthen shield spawns.
* Falling grubs no longer show an attack option until they land, preventing misclicks during the spawn animation.

