==Live Events Survey==
We're continuing to explore the idea of hosting live, in-person events in the US in 2026! It's still early days but we want to understand more about what kind of events you would like to see and what they would include.

We really want your input to help us create an event you'd love to attend!

Please note any US-based event discussed in the survey is not a replacement for RuneFest. We're currently exploring our next steps for RuneFest separately and will share plans with you all in due course.

Fill out the survey below and let us know!

